greptimedb provides C++26 columnar ingestion, SQL, PromQL, DDL,
reflected rows, Arrow Flight streaming, and per-thread client pools.

    find_package(greptimedb CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE greptimedb::greptimedb)

The umbrella header is <greptimedb/greptimedb.h>.
greptimedb::greptimedb is the installed client surface. greptimedb::client is
the unary client. greptimedb::flight is the Flight DoPut and DoGet surface.
Domain modules link separately as greptimedb::core, greptimedb::batch,
greptimedb::row, greptimedb::proto, greptimedb::flight_ipc, greptimedb::streaming, and
greptimedb::threading.

The port fetches the pinned
greptime-proto tree and passes it as GREPTIME_PROTO_DIR with the fetcher-attested
GREPTIME_PROTO_VERIFIED_REVISION.

Generate portfile.cmake and vcpkg.json from the .in templates using the
release version and verified @GIT_COMMIT_SHA@.
